{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Adventurer's Guild is located east of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," and is the home of ",["l","马龙","Marlon"]," and ",["l","吉尔","Gil"],". There the player can purchase ",["l","武器","Weapons"],", ",["l","鞋类","Boots"],", and ",["l","戒指","Rings"],". Marlon will also buy weapons, boots, and rings, as well as ",["l","怪物战利品","Monster Loot"]," from the player."]],["p",["To access the Adventurer's Guild, the player must first complete the story quest ",["l","任务#Initiation","\"Initiation\""],". Once completed, the guild is open daily from 2pm to 2am, except on festival days when the door is locked."]]]],["Interior Layout",2,[["p",["Inside the Adventurer's Guild building players can find ",["l","马龙","Marlon"]," manning the counter, offering weapons, boots and rings for sale. ",["l","吉尔","Gil"]," is sitting in his rocking chair beside the fire, and just to the left of the fireplace is the monster eradication goal list."]],["p",["Neither ",["l","马龙","Marlon"]," nor ",["l","吉尔","Gil"]," accept gifts, gain ",["l","友谊","friendship"]," points, or have bedrooms for the player to enter. The back room of the guild is accessible only after slaying 1,000 monsters. In that room, there is a box containing the ",["l","洞穴地图绘制法","Mapping Cave Systems"]," book."]],["g",[["Adventurer's_Guild_Interior.png",300,[]]]]]],["Monster Eradication Goals",2,[["p",["A list of how many of certain types of ",["l","怪物","monsters"]," killed is stored on the wall to the right of Marlon's desk. When the allotted amount has been slain, Gil will give the player a reward. Previously earned rewards can be purchased from Marlon. If the player has a full inventory and cannot take the reward(s) from ",["l","吉尔","Gil"],", when they close the inventory they will be unable to retrieve the reward from him. If the inventory is full they can select the item in the dialog and drop it on the floor. It will remain on the floor while they sort out space in their inventory. Otherwise the player will have to purchase the item from ",["l","马龙","Marlon"],"."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Monster Type"]},{"h":1,"v":["Quantity"]},{"h":1,"v":["Reward"]},{"h":1,"v":["Reward Description"]}],[[["f","Green_Slime.png",24]," ",["l","史莱姆","Slime"]," (any color,\nexcludes Big Slimes and Slimes in the ",["l","史莱姆屋","Slime Hutch"],")"],["1000"],[["i","(O)520","Slime Charmer Ring"]],["Prevents damage from slimes."]],[["Void Spirits:",["l","暗影萨满","Shadow Shaman"],"Shadow Shaman (dangerous)",["l","暗影狂徒","Shadow Brute"],"Shadow Brute (dangerous) ",["l","暗影狙击手","Shadow Sniper"]],["150"],[["i","(O)523","Savage Ring"]],["Gain a short speed boost whenever you slay a monster."]],[["Bats:BatBat (dangerous)",["l","蝙蝠","Frost Bat"],"Frost Bat (dangerous)",["l","蝙蝠","Lava Bat"],["l","蝙蝠","Iridium Bat"]],["200"],[["i","(O)522","Vampire Ring"]],["Gain a little health every time you slay a monster."]],[["Skeletons:",["i","(F)1304","Skeleton"],"Skeleton (dangerous)Skeleton Mage"],["50"],[["i","(H)8","Skeleton Mask"]],["The red eyes are glowing mysteriously."]],[["Cave Insects:",["l","臭虫","Bug"],"Bug (dangerous)",["l","苍蝇","Cave Fly"],"Cave Fly (dangerous)",["l","蛆","Grub"],"Grub (dangerous)",["l","突变苍蝇","Mutant Fly"]," ",["l","突变蛆","Mutant Grub"],["l","甲虫","Armored Bug"],"Armored Bug (dangerous)"],["80"],[["i","(W)13","Insect Head"]],["Not very pleasant to wield."]],[["Duggies:",["l","掘地虫","Duggy"],"Duggy (dangerous)",["l","熔岩掘地虫","Magma Duggy"]],["30"],[["i","(H)27","Hard Hat"]],["Keep your dome in one piece."]],[["Dust Sprites:",["l","灰尘精灵","Dust Sprite"],"Dust Sprite (dangerous)"],["500"],[["i","(O)526","Burglar's Ring"]],["Monsters have a greater chance of dropping loot."]],[["Rock Crabs:",["l","岩石蟹","Rock Crab"],"Rock Crab (dangerous)",["l","熔岩蟹","Lava Crab"],"Lava Crab (dangerous)",["l","铱蟹","Iridium Crab"]],["60"],[["i","(O)810","Crabshell Ring"]],["The top of the ring is made from enchanted crab shell."]],[["Mummies:",["l","木乃伊","Mummy"],"Mummy (dangerous)"],["100"],[["i","(H)60","Arcane Hat"]],["The type of cowboy hat worn by a wizard."]],[[["l","霸王喷火龙","Pepper Rex"]],["50"],[["i","(H)50","Knight's Helmet"]],["It looks just like the real thing!"]],[["Serpents:",["l","飞蛇","Serpent"],["l","皇家飞蛇","Royal Serpent"]],["250"],[["i","(O)811","Napalm Ring"]],["When you defeat an enemy, they explode."]],[["Magma Sprites:",["l","熔岩精灵","Magma Sprite"],["l","熔岩火球","Magma Sparker"]],["150"],["Marlon's Phone Number"],["Can call to utilize Item Recovery Service from home"]]]]]],["Shop",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Unlocked"]},{"h":1,"v":["Buy Price"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[["f","Rusty_Sword.png",48]],[["l","生锈的剑","Rusty Sword"]],["A rusty, dull old sword."],[],["250g"],["50g"]],[[["f","Wooden_Blade.png",48]],[["l","木剑","Wooden Blade"]],["Not bad for a piece of carved wood."],[],["250g"],["50g"]],[[["f","Femur.png",48]],[["l","股骨","Femur"]],["An old, heavy bone caked in centuries of grime."],["Reach Floor 10 of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],"."],["350g"],["100g"]],[[["f","Iron_Dirk.png",48]],[["l","铁制短剑","Iron Dirk"]],["A common dagger."],["Reach Floor 15 of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],"."],["500g"],["50g"]],[[["f","Silver_Saber.png",48]],[["l","镀银军刀","Silver Saber"]],["Plated with silver to deter rust."],["Reach Floor 20 of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],"."],["750g"],["100g"]],[[["f","Elf_Blade.png",48]],[["l","精灵之刃","Elf Blade"]],["Only the nimble hands of an elf could craft this."],["Reach Floor 20 of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],"."],["750g"],["100g"]],[[["f","Steel_Smallsword.png",48]],[["l","钢制轻剑","Steel Smallsword"]],["A standard metal blade."],["Reach Floor 20 of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],"."],["750g"],["50g"]],[[["f","Pirate's_Sword.png",48]],[["l","海盗剑","Pirate's Sword"]],["It looks like a pirate owned this once."],["Reach Floor 25 of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],"."],["850g"],["100g"]],[[["f","Cutlass.png",48]],[["l","弯刀","Cutlass"]],["A finely crafted blade."],["Reach Floor 25 of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],"."],["1,5